{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>But against all the children of Israel, etc.</b> And this is the miracle — for even though we say that when dogs bark the Angel of Death has come to the city. And if so, it was fitting that they should bark at the time of the plague of the firstborn — even so, 'against all the children of Israel, not a dog shall sharpen its tongue.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:08.396919060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}